    values:originalText "(2) An issuing agency that is a Territory agency of a particular Territory and that receives a request under section 15XL must comply with the request to the extent that the laws of the Territory require it to do so. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 26 May 2005 Senate on 14 June 2005] (73/05)" ;
